[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4239142155","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118536#issuecomment-4239142155","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118536","id":4239142155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78rC0L","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-13T19:40:32Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T19:42:13Z","body":"In my assessment on the issue, I said\r\n> that sync is absolutely necessary\r\n\r\nwhich turned out to be a half-truth. \r\nIf the parent is a `Container`, then we need to let it know so that it can update its own minimum size. That much is true.\r\nHowever, `Container` nodes also react to their children's `minimum_size_changed` signals, which can be triggered through this non-invalidating path. So my claim that we needed to go through **that** sync path was false. \r\n\r\nI think the whole invalidation may actually not be necessary at all for any codepath, since only `Container` nodes need to fit their children, and they don't need invalidation to do so. But that's out of scope for this bugfix PR. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4239142155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4243795759","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118536#issuecomment-4243795759","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118536","id":4243795759,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc788y8v","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T12:16:45Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T12:16:45Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4243795759/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]